Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights
to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or
sell copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the
Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:

  (a) The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be
      included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

  (b) If in a calendar year the Covered Revenue of You and every
      entity under common control with You exceeds US $1,000,000,
      You shall pay Licensor 3% of the amount above US $1,000,000,
      as Section 6 provides. "Covered Revenue" is receipts from
      competing products and services You supply, less refunds,
      chargebacks, and transaction taxes, attributed as Section 4
      provides. For this license, a competing product or service
      meets both of these tests:

      (i) It contains the Software, is derived from it, or provides
          its functionality to others by running it.

      (ii) Customers can use it in place of the Software, or in
           place of a product or service Licensor offered using
           the Software when this version was released.

      A different name or target market does not, by itself, make
      a product or service noncompeting. Revenue from noncompeting
      products and services is not Covered Revenue.

      If Covered Revenue does not exceed US $1,000,000, this
      condition is satisfied for the year with no act on Your part.

Both (a) and (b) are conditions of this grant, not independent
covenants. Exercising the rights granted here without satisfying
them, subject to the cure and good-faith provisions of Section 6, is
outside the scope of this license.

In this license, the "Software" is the version of the work identified
in the License Details above, in source or binary form, including
modifications of it and works derived from it; a work is derived
from the Software only if it would infringe copyright in the
Software without this license; the "Package" is the software line of
which this Software is one version; and "You" means the person or
legal entity exercising these rights.


